  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jungle Ventures V, L.P. (Jungle V) is a multisector fund that will invest in companies operating in the consumer, financial services, and business services sectors, which are being driven by macroeconomic tailwinds in the fund&apos;s target countries. These tailwind factors include population growth, rising education levels, improving household incomes, and increased consumer spending.</narrative>
